---
source: crates/jailint/tests/rules.rs
---
error[double_free]: `node` is freed a second time
  --> tests/lint/double_free/bad.jai:11:5
   |
 8 |     node := New(Node);
   |             --------- storage derived here
   ...
10 |     free(node);
   |     ---------- storage invalidated here
11 |     free(node);
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: remove the second call, or assign `node` a new value in between
   |
10       free(node);
11 -     free(node);
12
   |
   = note: `double_free` is `deny` by default
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/double_free

